{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 26, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and make ready to embark on a journey to the land of the rising sun, Japan.\n\n\nIn the heart of Tokyo, first, thou shalt visit the bustling metropolis of Shibuya, where the crosswalks are filled with people, much like the streets of London during market day.\n\n\nNext, thou shalt venture to the Meiji Shrine, a place of great spiritual significance, dedicated to the deified spirits of Emperor Meiji and his wife, Empress Shōken.\n\n\nAfterward, thou shalt journey to the historic Asakusa district, where thou shalt find the Sensō-ji, a Buddhist temple built in the 7th century. Here, thou shalt offer a prayer for safe travels and a prosperous journey.\n \\*\\*\n\nOn the second day, thou shalt take a train to the ancient city of Kamakura, where thou shalt find the Great Buddha of Kamakura, a monumental outdoor statue of Amida Buddha.\n\n\nThen, thou shalt travel to the Hakone Open-Air Museum, where thou shalt find a vast collection of contemporary sculptures, spread across the beautiful mountainous landscape.\n\n\nLastly, thou shalt take a boat ride on Lake Ashi, where thou shalt enjoy the breathtaking view of Mount Fuji, the highest mountain in Japan.\n\n\nOn the third day, thou shalt visit the former imperial capital, Kyoto. Here, thou shalt explore the Fushimi Inari Shrine, known for its thousands of vermilion torii gates.\n\n\nNext, thou shalt visit the Kinkaku-ji, a Zen temple whose top two floors are completely covered in gold leaf.\n\n\nFinally, thou shalt end the day with a visit to the Gion district, where thou shalt have the chance to see a Geisha, a traditional female entertainer, in her full regalia.\n\n\nOn the fourth day, thou shalt take a train to Hiroshima, a city that was devastated by an atomic bomb during World War II. Here, thou shalt visit the Peace Memorial Park and Museum, where thou shalt pay homage to the victims of the bombing and reflect on the importance of peace.\n\n\nOn the fifth day, thou shalt return to Tokyo, where thou shalt have the evening to explore the city at thy leisure.\n\n\nOn the sixth day, thou shalt visit the historic city of Nikko, where thou shalt find the Toshogu Shrine, a UNESCO World Heritage Site and the mausoleum of Tokugawa Ieyasu, the founder of the Tokugawa shogunate.\n\n\nOn the seventh day, thou shalt have a day of rest and reflection, where thou shalt contemplate the beauty and the history of Japan, and the memories that thou hast made during thy journey.\n\n\nThus, the itinerary for thy journey to Japan is complete. I pray that thou hast a safe and prosperous journey, and that thou returneth home with a heart full of joy and a mind full of wonders.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013940464705228806}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.4145479202270508}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.043870359659194946}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.6569954823353328e-05}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.02116977609694004}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0013780631124973297}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "arise", "logprob": -0.07260089367628098}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -4.529942543740617e-06}, {"token": "make", "logprob": -0.025980498641729355}, {"token": "ready", "logprob": -2.2551608085632324}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -0.007631788495928049}, {"token": "emb", "logprob": -0.039181243628263474}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "on", "logprob": -0.02325243502855301}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -0.0019269485492259264}, {"token": "journey", "logprob": -0.22124308347702026}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -0.42428240180015564}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.006820374168455601}, {"token": "land", "logprob": -0.1050512045621872}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.502025770